  "description": "I passed out after a day filled with misfortune. When I later opened my eyes, I was inside my favorite novel. Unfortunately, I was reincarnated as the villainess who was ruined after wreaking havoc due to her obsession with the male lead… That doesn’t matter! I won’t become a villainess, and will instead match my favorite character in this novel, the second male lead, with the heroine! But this is… harder than I imagined?!?! \n\n*“Are you alright?”*\n\nThe captain of the knights who was supposed to be the heroine’s bodyguard ended up as my own. \n\n*“I got it for free on the way here. Eat it.”*\n\nThe guy who is supposed to help the two end up together keeps going off track by 3000%. \n\n*“Are you out of your mind? I told you to be careful!”*\n\nAnd the male lead who is supposed to hate me is annoyingly hovering around. \n\n*”I’ll feed you, Lia!”*\n\nEven the heroine had no interest in anyone, not even the original male lead?! Not only that! \n\n*“Thank you. I’ll treasure it.”*\n\nMy heart started beating for Ain who suddenly appeared without warning! Will Lia be able to save the second male lead’s love?",
